    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "State with highest forest cover area-wise: Madhya Pradesh; State with highest percentage forest cover: Mizoram.",
        "Crucial match-the-following pairs: Wildlife Protection Act (1972), Project Tiger (1973), Environment Protection Act (1986), Forest Conservation Act (1980).",
        "Key distinction: Grazing and private rights are strictly prohibited inside National Parks but may be allowed in Wildlife Sanctuaries."
      ],
